sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Admin User
    participant Interceptor as AuditLogInterceptor<br/>(APP_INTERCEPTOR 글로벌)
    participant Reflector
    participant Handler as Controller<br/>(@AdminAction)
    participant Repo as AuditLogRepository
    participant Logger

    Client->>Interceptor: HTTP Request<br/>PATCH /admin/users/:id/status
    Interceptor->>Reflector: getAllAndOverride(ADMIN_ACTION_KEY)

    alt @AdminAction 메타데이터 없음
        Reflector-->>Interceptor: undefined
        Interceptor->>Handler: next.handle()
        Handler-->>Client: response (audit log 건너뜀)
    else 메타데이터 있음
        Reflector-->>Interceptor: AdminActionMeta { action, targetType }
        Interceptor->>Handler: next.handle()
        Handler-->>Interceptor: 응답값

        Note over Interceptor: tap operator<br/>응답을 client에<br/>통과시키며<br/>동시에 side effect 실행<br/>(응답 지연 0)

        Interceptor-->>Client: 응답 전달

        Interceptor->>Interceptor: maskSensitive(req.body)<br/>password / token / secret / accessToken / refreshToken → '***'
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: extractTargetId(req.params.id)
        Interceptor->>Repo: insert({adminUserId: user?.id ?? 'unknown',<br/>action, targetType, targetId,<br/>requestBody (masked), responseStatus,<br/>ipAddress, userAgent})

        alt INSERT 성공
            Repo-->>Interceptor: void
        else INSERT 실패
            Repo--xInterceptor: Error (DB 장애 등)
            Interceptor->>Logger: logger.error<br/>(응답에는 이미 전달돼 영향 X)
        end
    end
